          </div>

          <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 py-24 w-full">
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">

              <div class="hero-left" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B6B]/15 border border-[#FF6B6B]/30 mb-8">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF6B6B] animate-pulse"></span>
                  <span class="text-[#FF6B6B] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">AI Operations Platform</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-6" style="line-height:1.25">
                  Cloud9<br>
                  <span class="relative inline-block pb-4">
                    AI Operations
                    <span class="absolute bottom-1 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-[#FF6B6B] rounded-full hero-underline" style="transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left"></span>
                  </span><br>
                  <span class="text-[#00B4D8]">Platform</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-white/65 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-lg">
                  A team of AI Specialists embedded in your Microsoft 365 environment, handling proposals, hiring, and operations while learning from every engagement.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                  <a href="#s-challenge" class="px-6 py-3 bg-[#FF6B6B] text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-[#FF5252] transition-colors text-sm">See the opportunity</a>
                  <a href="#s-summary" class="px-6 py-3 bg-white/10 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors text-sm border border-white/20">Proposal summary</a>
                </div>
                <div class="flex gap-8 mt-12 pt-10 border-t border-white/10">
                  <div>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">~20<span class="text-[#FF6B6B]"> min</span></div>
                    <div class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-1">Per proposal (target)</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="w-px bg-white/10"></div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">6<span class="text-[#00B4D8]">+</span></div>
                    <div class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-1">AI Specialists planned</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="w-px bg-white/10"></div>
                  <div>
                    <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">M365<span class="text-[#FF6B6B]"> native</span></div>
                    <div class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-1">No new infrastructure</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="hero-right" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)">
                <div class="relative">
                  <div class="relative bg-white/8 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15 rounded-2xl p-7 specialist-float">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-5">
                      <div class="relative">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B2A4A] to-[#3A6B9F] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl border-2 border-[#FF6B6B]/40">JR</div>
                        <div class="absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 border-2 border-[#0D1F3C] flex items-center justify-center">
                          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping absolute"></div>
                          <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white"></div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div>
                        <div class="text-white font-bold text-lg">Jordan Reeves</div>
                        <div class="text-white/50 text-sm">Proposals Strategist</div>
                        <span class="inline-block mt-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#FF6B6B] text-white">Phase 1</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-3">
                      {[
                        { text: 'Generates complete proposals from a brief in under 20 minutes' },
                        { text: 'Draws on Cloud9\'s past proposals and deliveries automatically' },
                        { text: 'Challenges approaches that won\'t win - and explains why' },
                      ].map(item => (
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 text-white/75 text-sm">
